u can have it.","msg_0488_T06R0301_00004":"Hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rDid you come see me about my\\nPokémon again?\\rNo? Oh... I had more tales to tell...","msg_0488_T06R0301_00005":"Hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rDid you come see me about my\\nPokémon again?\\rNo? Oh... I had more tales to tell...","msg_0488_T06R0301_00006":"How disappointing...\\rCome back if you want to listen\\nto me again!","msg_0488_T06R0301_00007":"Your Bag is jammed full.","msg_0488_T06R0301_00008":"Our Chairman is very vocal when it\\ncomes to Pokémon...","msg_0488_T06R0301_00009":"I love the way CLEFAIRY opens up\\nits arms!\\rIt’s so adorable!","msg_0488_T06R0301_00010":"I love CLEFAIRY, but I could never\\ncatch one.\\rSo I’m making do with a Poké Doll\\nthat I found.","msg_0488_T06R0301_00011":"I love CLEFAIRY, but I could never\\ncatch one. So I’m making do with a\\fPoké Doll that I found.\\rWhat?\\nThe girl who lost this Poké Doll\\fis sad...!\\rOK. Could you take this Poké Doll\\nback to that poor little girl?\\rI’ll befriend a real CLEFAIRY on\\nmy own one day!\\r","msg_0488_T06R0301_00012":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\\nthe lost Poké Doll!","msg_0488_T06R0301_00013":"You watch. I’m going to get a\\nreal CLEFAIRY as my friend.","msg_0488_T06R0301_00014":"Look at my darling BAYLEEF!\\rThe leaf on its head is so cute\\nand fashionable!","msg_0488_T06R0301_00015":"It’s a CLEFAIRY!\\nHuh?\\rOh, right. It’s a CLEFAIRY Poké Doll.","msg_0488_T06R0301_00016":"BAYLEEF: Li liif!","msg_0488_T06R0301_00017":"Let’s all listen politely to\\nother Trainers.","msg_0488_T06R0301_00018":"If someone brags, brag right back!"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T06R0301_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T06R0301_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T06R0301_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T06R0301_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T06R0301_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T06R0301_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T06R0301_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T06R0301_007":7,"obj_T06R0301_gsgentleman":0,"obj_T06R0301_gswoman2":1,"obj_T06R0301_gswoman1":2,"obj_T06R0301_gsbigma